        "highlight_text_color": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "description": "<p>Most of these technologies have a function, a purpose, and an expiration period.</p><ol><li>A function is a particular task a technology has. So a function can be to “store certain data.”</li><li>Purpose is “the Why” behind the function. Maybe the data is stored because it is needed for statistics.</li><li>The expiration period shows the length of the period the used technology can “store or read certain data.”</li></ol>",
