        "highlight_style_color": "",
        "highlight_text_color": "",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "description": "<p>When you visit our website for the first time, we will show you a pop-up with an explanation about cookies. You do have the right to opt-out and to object against the further use of non-functional cookies.</p><p><strong>Manage your opt-out preferences</strong></p>",
